1
00:00:00,392 --> 00:00:03,892
(Penny:)What can I say? I got my geek on, boys.

2
00:00:04,229 --> 00:00:05,809
[KNOCK ON DOOR]

3
00:00:06,189 --> 00:00:09,989
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)No, no, PMS is different.

4
00:00:11,945 --> 00:00:13,695
(Alicia:)Thank God you're home. I need help.

5
00:00:13,906 --> 00:00:16,446
- What's wrong?
- I got a callback to audition for CSI...

6
00:00:16,658 --> 00:00:20,658
(Alicia:)- ...to play a hooker who gets killed.
- Oh, I'd watch that.

7
00:00:21,830 --> 00:00:25,500
(Alicia:)But my car is in the shop
and I have to be at Universal in 45 minutes.

8
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:28,837
- Okay, well, I'll take you.
ALICIA: Oh, you're a lifesaver.

9
00:00:29,004 --> 00:00:31,214
- I'll run lines with you in the car.
ALICIA: Great.

10
00:00:31,423 --> 00:00:34,053
(Alicia:)And afterward,
I'll take you all out for Chinese.

11
00:00:34,259 --> 00:00:37,679
(Penny:)- Actually, that's okay. We already have...
LEONARD: I'm starving.

12
00:00:38,847 --> 00:00:39,887
[DOOR CLOSES]

13
00:00:40,057 --> 00:00:43,097
(Penny:)...Chinese food right here.

14
00:00:43,685 --> 00:00:46,275
(Sheldon:)They're gone, Penny.
They can't hear you.

15
00:00:48,190 --> 00:00:51,400
(Penny:)I cannot believe they're letting her
just use them like that.

16
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:54,740
(Penny:)Anything she wants,
they go panting after her like trained dogs.

17
00:00:54,947 --> 00:00:57,697
(Penny:)Just last week, she had Howard
drive to her uncle's house...

18
00:00:57,908 --> 00:01:00,018
(Penny:)...in Orange County to pick up her TV?

